&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6041&quot; title=&quot;When using the SQL acceleration interface to accelerate multiple SQL queries, the interface returns success, but no indexes are generated&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-6041&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-6041&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; If modelContext is SnapshotSelected, do not collectResponseOfReusedModels&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17941178" author="liyang.gmt8@gmail.com" created="Sat, 5 Apr 2025 02:07:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;close as kylin 5.0.2 released&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
